# Sibling git worktrees checked out INSIDE this directory (2026-09-04).
# Without this, a `git add -A` here records the worktree as a phantom
# gitlink (mode 160000) with no .gitmodules entry — which is exactly what
# happened to CoBacTyPhu-asym and what this commit removes: a fresh clone
# got a broken empty directory pinned to a stale commit of another branch.
CoBacTyPhu-asym/
